# Prüfstand-DE

German-language RAG test cases of the open-source release gate
[Prüfstand](https://github.com/dheena18/pruefstand): questions, reference answers, gold citations
and security probes over German and EU law, split into `smoke`, `core`, `robust_pr`, `full` and
`rq1`. Version `{{ name }}/{{ version }}`, corpus `{{ corpus_version }}`.

Every case has exactly one `license_config`; each config below is a separate Hugging Face config
with its own licence. Load one with
`datasets.load_dataset("{{ repo_id }}", "<config>", split="core")`.

